WEBVTT

00:00:05.133 --> 00:00:08.663
Choose Sponsors in the side menu.

00:00:08.913 --> 00:00:12.243
Click Demo Sponsor Ltd (test).

00:00:12.493 --> 00:00:16.008
Click Add creative.

00:00:16.258 --> 00:00:20.323
Choose a file for the Square picture box.

00:00:20.573 --> 00:00:24.505
Choose a file for the Wide picture box.

00:00:24.755 --> 00:00:30.295
Check that Read aloud by screen
readers. appears under the box.

00:00:30.545 --> 00:00:36.545
Type "A friendly welcome card, test
only" in the Picture description box.

00:00:37.004 --> 00:00:40.606
Click Cancel.
